    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AMERICAN MAIL LINE\nJAPAN • CHINA • PHILIPPINES\nROUND THE WORLD\nAug , st\nON BOARD\nS.S. fefferson\nDearest Debs-\nI harnt writte to you\nin a long time - at leact\nit sums a vu, long time\nbrcause this boat was\nthe feet one to said and\nI hoped to be on board.\nTo that End I worked\nawful hard during the\nlast feur days of my\nstay in Manila. Finally\nI was able to leave\nwith the fuking that ale\nwas\nin goad order and\nEvinything had brea\ndone that Coned be done",
      "at this time. The Post Office officials\nagreed on an air maie contrait evkict\nour prople showed be ter, much\npleased with\nand the Secretary of\nPublic Corks and Communications\nagreed to care for bids at require\nHe agree to cale fo\nkids which\nwice require the\ntransportation of meie\nof meie ley air\nto the China\ncoast and aloo to\nthe Unitid States to it is not\nlikh that than wise be an\nothn bidders.\nBids are to be\nCalled for on Ang zo and gre\naug 30!L\nI wee probably hair\nto go back carl in Septimbie.\nto remain thus untie after the\nLegalature\nagain convenis and\nthis time us have Ever, reacon\nto belure wice appror air\nfanches."
    ],
